    "subject": "The greeting script says Helo instead of Hello",
    "description": {
     "format": "markdown",
     "raw": "### Problem/Motivation\n\n`bash greeting.sh World` prints `Helo, World!`.\n\n### Proposed resolution\n\nPrint `Hello, World!`, and keep the usage line as it is.\n",
     "html": "<h3 id=\"op-frag-problemmotivation\" class=\"op-uc-h3\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-problemmotivation\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>Problem/Motivation</h3>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\"><code class=\"op-uc-code\">bash greeting.sh World</code> prints <code class=\"op-uc-code\">Helo, World!</code>.</p>\n<h3 id=\"op-frag-proposed-resolution\" class=\"op-uc-h3\">\n<a href=\"#op-frag-proposed-resolution\" aria-hidden=\"true\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"op-uc-link_permalink icon-link op-uc-link\"></a>Proposed resolution</h3>\n<p class=\"op-uc-p\">Print <code class=\"op-uc-code\">Hello, World!</code>, and keep the usage line as it is.</p>"
    },
